msgstr "Eliminar a %(username)s"

msgid "Delete account"
msgstr "Eliminar cuenta"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Delete the provider %(provider)s? Its users will not be able to log in "
"with it."
msgstr ""
"¿Eliminar el proveedor %(provider)s? Sus usuarios no podrán ingresar con "
"él."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Delete the user %(username)s and their data, such as their preferences "
"and progress? Their activity stays in the log. This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"¿Eliminar al usuario %(username)s y sus datos, como sus preferencias y "
"progreso? Su actividad se mantiene en la bitácora. Esto no se puede "
"deshacer."

